@startuml
title Echoes of the Majestic — карта локаций
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 100
skinparam ranksep 80
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Стыковочный отсек\ndock\nСТАРТ: 85 HP\nПредмет: pistol" as LocDock #DDEEFF
rectangle "Входной отсек\nintake" as LocIntake
rectangle "Хирургический медотсек\nmedbay\nПредмет: kit\nВраг: husk_drifter (14 HP, атака 5)\nЖурнал: medbay_body" as LocMedbay
rectangle "Служебный архив\narchive\nПредмет: alpha\nЖурнал: archive_signal" as LocArchive
rectangle "Механический цех\nmachine_shop\nПредмет: cutter" as LocShop
rectangle "Пост охраны\nsecurity\nПредметы: keycard, lens\nВраг: warden_spine (26 HP, атака 10)\nЖурнал: security_station" as LocSecurity
rectangle "Реакторная шахта\nreactor_spine\nВраг: root_heart (34 HP, атака 12)\nЖурнал: reactor_resonance\nПобеда над врагом → root_heart_destroyed" as LocReactor #FFE0DD
rectangle "Командный мостик\ncommand_bridge\nИспользовать lens при наличии alpha\n→ beacon_online" as LocBridge #FFF0CC
rectangle "Ангар шаттлов\nshuttle_bay\nПОБЕДА при обоих флагах:\nbeacon_online + root_heart_destroyed" as LocShuttle #DDF2DD

LocDock -down-> LocIntake : south
LocIntake -up-> LocDock : north
LocIntake -left-> LocMedbay : west
LocMedbay -right-> LocIntake : east
LocIntake -down-> LocArchive : south
LocArchive -up-> LocIntake : north
LocArchive -right-> LocShop : east
LocShop -left-> LocArchive : west
LocArchive -down-> LocSecurity : south
LocSecurity -up-> LocArchive : north
LocShop -right-> LocReactor : east
LocReactor -left-> LocShop : west
LocSecurity -right-> LocBridge : east [есть keycard]
LocBridge -left-> LocSecurity : west
LocBridge -right-> LocShuttle : east
LocShuttle -left-> LocBridge : west [есть keycard]
@enduml
